        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arun Date\n- Songs: “Shukratara”\n- Organizations: Mumbai Radio Station\n- Concepts: Bhavageete, Bhavageeth, expressionist poetry, light music, contemporary Marathi culture\n\nFacts:\n- In 1962, Mumbai Radio Station adjudged Arun Date’s song “Shukratara” as song of the month.\n- Arun Date’s song “Shukratara” remains one of the most popular songs in contemporary Marathi culture.\n- Bhavageete, also called Bhavageeth, literally means “emotion poetry.”\n- Bhavageete is a form of expressionist poetry and light music.",
